WEBVTT

00:02:56.663 --> 00:03:00.329
You'll be surprised at how fresh air drives fresh thinking,

00:03:00.329 --> 00:03:01.913
and in the way that you do,

00:03:01.913 --> 00:03:05.454
you'll bring into your life an entirely new set of ideas.

00:03:05.454 --> 00:03:07.163
Thank you.

00:03:07.163 --> 00:03:11.413
(Applause)